<title>JAPAN: Greek railway may issue samurais this week-sources.</title>
<headline>Greek railway may issue samurais this week-sources.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greece's state railway firm, the Greek Railways Organisation (OSE) may launch samurai bonds within this week, underwriting sources said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;OSE is expected to issue 8.7 billion yen worth of samurais, with a duration of 20 years,&quot; an underwriter said. They said OSE had picked Daiwa Securities as a lead manager for the issue.</p>
</text>
